[SPEAKER_01]: So, then, you deal with whatever problem or task you had to deal with.

100
00:11:29,376 --> 00:11:34,237
[SPEAKER_01]: And, naturally, you already know that your mind is tending, actually, in the opposite direction of avoiding it.

101
00:11:35,157 --> 00:11:37,338
[SPEAKER_01]: So, you don't have to worry that you're doing something unwholesome.

102
00:11:38,798 --> 00:11:44,740
[SPEAKER_01]: And then, now, if you went in the opposite direction of, like, oh, well, let me seek out people, because I see that my mind resisted.

103
00:11:45,280 --> 00:11:45,500
[SPEAKER_01]: Well,

104
