[SPEAKER_01]: There's actually a sutra where the Buddha says that...

105
00:12:04,121 --> 00:12:26,787
[SPEAKER_01]: It talks about all the jhānas, and then it says, if a monk, then, if his mind inclines towards sitting, any of the four postures, he sits, or he stands, or he walks, and then it even says, if his mind inclines towards speaking, he speaks, or if his mind inclines towards being silent, he will be silent.

106
00:12:27,528 --> 00:12:32,869
[SPEAKER_01]: In other words, it's not automatic, as people might think, that you would always be

107
